{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":26,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":26,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b0508a1beecf50d3848100e","chatId":"89d672269ae04e24abc248983a94d1f1","sessionId":null,"userId":130807,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"You're right that you can't manufacture the feeling. But there's a gap between \"be mad for me\" and \"here's what I actually needed\" — the second one isn't a script, it's information. She's been getting the calculator version of you for years; she may have plenty of mad in her that's never had a reason to come out, because you keep handing her a spreadsheet instead.\n\nThe ask isn't \"feel this.\" It's \"don't fix it yet.\" That's a much smaller thing to say.\n\nWhat happens if you just tell her the number — and then sit there without reaching for anything?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"You're right that you can't manufacture the feeling. But there's a gap between \"be mad for me\" and \"here's what I actually needed\" — the second one isn't a script, it's information. She's been getting the calculator version of you for years; she may have plenty of mad in her that's never had a reason to come out, because you keep handing her a spreadsheet instead.\n\nThe ask isn't \"feel this.\" It's \"don't fix it yet.\" That's a much smaller thing to say.\n\nWhat happens if you just tell her the number — and then sit there without reaching for anything?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5002,"promptTokens":1046,"completionTokens":352,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 11:46:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTra